=== Switch Expressions Sample ===
--- Constant patterns: integer ---
Day 3 is Wednesday
--- Constant patterns: string ---
Command 'quit' => Goodbye!
--- Constant patterns: boolean ---
isActive=True => Active
--- Discard pattern (var _) ---
Code 99 => Other
--- Bare discard pattern (_) ---
Code 50 => Other
--- Var pattern catch-all ---
Value 42 => many (42)
--- Type patterns with type union ---
mixed (int) => integer: 123
mixed (string) => string: hello
--- Relational patterns ---
Temperature 75 => Comfortable
--- Logical patterns ---
Score 85 => Grade B
--- Property patterns ---
Word 'extraordinary' (length 13) => long
--- List patterns ---
Array [1,2,3] => starts with 1, 2
--- When guards ---
Number -5 => negative
Amount 150 => premium (value=150)
--- Expression contexts: assignment ---
num2=2 parity=even
--- Expression contexts: method argument ---
Level: Advanced
--- Expression contexts: tuple scrutinee ---
(0,0) => origin
(1,0) => on x-axis
Done!
